    en: Emily heard your footsteps from far away. Before you could say anything,
      she spoke directly.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 1
    enBranch:
    - '"He was not skilled enough. There is nothing to say."'
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 1
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 2
    expression: 1
    showCg: 1
    cgNum: 11
    minigameType: 0
    uncomfortType: 0
  - cn: "\u201C\u6211\u963B\u6B62\u4E0D\u4E86\u4ED6\uFF0C\u51B5\u4E14\u8FD9\u4EF6\u4E8B\u4E5F\u6CA1\u6709\u5546\u91CF\u7684\u4F59\u5730\uFF0C\u4F46\u6211\u4E0D\u4F1A\u505A\u6CA1\u6709\u6CA1\u6709\u628A\u63E1\u7684\u4E8B\u60C5\u3002\u201D"
    en: '"I could not stop him, and there was no room to discuss the matter anyway.
      But I do not do things I am not sure of."'
    cnHaveBranch: 0
